# A Tale for the Ages: "Enchanted" means any Aura is attached (CR 303.4), whoever controls it and token or not. Bot1 casts the
# Tale and Monstrous Rage on its Memnite: the Monster Role token (+1/+1, a token Aura) and the Tale make it 1+2+1+2 = 6/4 that
# turn (Rage's +2/+0 lasts until end of turn) and 4/4 afterwards. On turn two Bot2's Pacifism goes on Bot1's Ornithopter: an Aura
# Bot2 controls, but the creature is Bot1's, so the Tale makes it 2/4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Memnite
Ornithopter
A Tale for the Ages
Monstrous Rage
Plains x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Pacifism
